OL,3,GNEWSAMan bailed after pedestrians hurt
OL,4,Ain hit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has been released on bail
OL,7,Ffollowing a hit-and-run in Leicester.
OL,9,FDetectives are continuing to
OL,10,Finvestigate after four men were hit by
OL,11,Fa vehicle in Vaughan Way on Saturday
OL,12,Fnight.
OL,14,FLeicestershire Police said three of the
OL,15,Fmen, who had been crossing the road at
OL,16,Fthe time, were taken to hospital, where
OL,17,Ftwo of them were undergoing treatment
OL,18,Ffor "serious injuries". A fourth man
OL,19,Fgot up and walked away.
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
