OL,3,GNEWSAMan bailed after pedestrians hurt
OL,4,Ain hit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA 38-year-old man who was arrested on
OL,7,Fsuspicion of causing serious injury by
OL,8,Fdangerous driving, driving while over
OL,9,Fthe prescribed limit for alcohol, and
OL,10,Fcausing grievous bodily harm, has been
OL,11,Freleased on bail "pending further
OL,12,Finquiries", the force added.
